      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       DATA DIVISION.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       COPY "copyfile/link/nummervg".

       77 kzausgr                           PIC 9(01) VALUE ZERO.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.                                              
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*

       main SECTION.

          string adress;

          perform selektion until kzausgr not = 0.

          move zeroes to pfad.
          adress = selektion(pfad, dateiname)

       main-ende.
          EXIT.



I-42   selektion SECTION.
IQWDR-     MOVE 1                           to kzausgr.
IQWDR-     if (art-gr >= vgruppe) 
IQWDR-        (art-gr <= bgruppe)
IQWDR-        move zero                     to kzausgr
IQWDR-     end-if.
       selektion-ende.
           EXIT.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
